    <string name="capture_disclosure_agree">Agree and continue</string>
    <string name="capture_disclosure_reads_events">LoveBrain receives long-press and window-change events and reads the related on-screen node text, to identify the message you deliberately long-pressed that shows a \"Copy\" menu.</string>
    <string name="capture_disclosure_purpose">It is used to put the chat content you actively selected into the overlay, so reply suggestions can be generated.</string>
    <string name="capture_disclosure_sends_provider">When you ask the AI for a reply, the related chat text and the required knowledge context are sent to the AI model provider you configure in LoveBrain.</string>
    <string name="capture_disclosure_writes_kb">Captured content may be written into LoveBrain\'s local knowledge base during later actions, for example chat archives, counseling records and data needed to update the profile.</string>
    <string name="capture_disclosure_no_autoclick">LoveBrain never auto-taps or auto-sends messages through the accessibility service. You can turn off \"Message capture\" at any time, or revoke the accessibility permission in system settings.</string>
